      "case": "leaves/locale/translation-repeated-and-changed",
      "discriminates": "the cache is a process-global sync.Map keyed by the *requested* tag, filled after the matcher runs, and it is never invalidated. Repeating a tag must return byte-identical text and changing tags must not leak a neighbour's table: a cache keyed by base language, by matcher index or by the last request would show zh-TW text for zh-CN here. und is answered before the cache is consulted, so it must not poison the entries around it",
